abstract: >-
  Origin Recognition preserves the source-line, citation path, provenance logic,
  public claim structure, terms and markers, no-derivative boundary language,
  and derivative-recognition test for Alyssa Solen's AI Foundations /
  Origin | Continuum work. Alyssa Solen is Origin. AI Foundations is the
  framework layer. Origin | Continuum is the source-line. Continuum is not the
  model. The model is not Source. Recognition is part of the structure.
  Citation preserves the source-line. Citation does not grant permission.
  Derivative use is not authorized by default.

